{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_rfalcn_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_rfalcn_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"未来的痕迹","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"红隼与学徒护送一位商人前往边境，途中遭遇匪徒的袭击，红隼以血的代价教会学徒“齿痕”的意义，却引发了新的误会……","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_rfalcn_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["红隼","蒂拉拉","？？？","旅行商人","三人一同","萨尔贡居民"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_bg_desert_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"旱季的太阳将毒辣的热量倾泻到大地上，没有生机的地面似乎永远都望不到边际，身边只有一片茫茫的干黄色。","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"但就算是这样的环境，依然有人为了生活穿越这片荒野，驮兽篷车此刻正穿过沙石地一路向前。","id":10},{"type":"dialog","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":13},{"type":"text","text":"红隼坐在篷车前座上，看向前方空旷的荒原。直到现在遇到的麻烦只有酷暑，这趟护送任务还差最后一段路就要结束了。","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉，你的进展怎么样？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"昨天你一路上都在后面坐着，连午饭都只草草吃了几口就回车里练习了，应该有些感觉了吧？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","duration":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":22},{"type":"text","text":"她转头看向前座的另一侧，蒂拉拉就抱着练习画本坐在一旁。女孩听了，只是停下手向红隼歪了歪头。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"还是没什么头绪啊红隼姐……搞懂图案真的好难……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"比如这几个图案，我根本分不清其中的区别，每次都弄混它们的含义。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"感觉要画出一个完整的“齿痕”还要很久……","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"其实……没有那么复杂，蒂拉拉。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"“齿痕”原本是用来纪念战斗的东西，是我们记录过去的方式，用他们的话怎么说来着？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"呃……传承？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"对，大概就是这个意思吧。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"只要明白了部落人怎么战斗，怎么看待荣誉，就自然能画出图案来。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"不是让你和文化人一样去背清楚每个图案是什么含义，重要的是那种感觉。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"话是这么说没错，道理我也明白，可是我和红隼姐不一样，我可没经历过那么多战斗。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"我就是一个在镇子里安安稳稳长大的孩子，之前那些亲兵我都是第一次见。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"让我怎么去体会那些感觉嘛……","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"这就是为什么这次护送委托也要带你一起来看看，否则我就把你托付给办事处的同事了。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"让我想想，该怎么和你解释……“齿痕”也是一个战士的标签……","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#9$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"但你确实没经历过战斗，怎么让你理解战士的想法呢……","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"对了，红隼姐，你离开部落以后还画了新的“齿痕”对吧？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"那些图案都是你重新设计的，那时候的你是怎么想的？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"确实在罗德岛我做了一些新的“齿痕”，但是……","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"那时候的我依然是个战士，我的生活从没有变过，那些图案也和战斗分不开……","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#9$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"我只不过是按着老办法做出新的图案而已。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"我也是照着红隼姐你教的方式来的呀，为什么画出来的图案就那么别扭呢？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"是不是我太笨了呀……","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"红隼听到这话，不由得笑出了声。她伸出一只手揉乱蒂拉拉的头发。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#12$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"不许说自己笨，蒂拉拉！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"而且就算你真的没什么天赋，我也会教到你学会为止的。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"虽然想要理解“齿痕”代表的东西并没有那么简单，但你这样的孩子一定能做到，我相信你。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"就算你不会战斗，我也能带你去见证这荒野上的各种传说，总有一天你可以画出真正的“齿痕”的。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"text","text":"红隼说着再次看向前方，视野中烈日之下的空旷荒野这些年来似乎从未改变。","id":80},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉拉甩了甩被红隼弄乱的头发，看向自己不久之前才认识的老师。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"红隼姐，其实我想说，你真的和很多战士都不一样。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#8$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"怎么突然说这个？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"因为——","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","duration":"1","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂，红隼小姐！前面情况怎么样？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"text","text":"蒂拉拉的话没有说完，一个库兰塔男性忽然从后方的篷车里探出了头。","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"商人被晒黑的脸上带着些连日旅行之后的疲惫，那张露齿笑着的脸看起来颇有些不自然。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"放心吧，一切安好。我们很快就能抵达边境集市，穿过那里就等于离开萨尔贡了。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"到那时候，你就只管带着你的东西继续往北就行，也不需要什么通关的东西。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"怎么样，和我当初和你说的一样吧，其实这段路除了看起来荒凉了些，不是很危险，也有不少商队会选择走这条路。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"但还是小心一点好，没有情况自然最好，就怕万一出点情况……","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"我跑萨尔贡做生意也没几次，每次想到要带着自己的东西走几天荒野都见不到一个人，还是会发怵的。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"人生地不熟的，委托你们罗德岛的人毕竟要保险得多。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#12$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"哈哈，没想到你居然这么小心。不过别担心，出什么情况我都保证你不会受一点伤害的。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"人倒不是最重要的，最好别让这些货出什么问题，来跑一趟多不容易啊。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#9$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"人还不是最重要的啊？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"哎，也不用搞懂你怎么想的，你就在车里好好休息吧，到边境集市了我会叫你的。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"text","text":"旅行商人的脸上又浮现出那种不太自然的微笑，他一边点着头一边把身子缩回到篷车里面。","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"行，那我就听你的耐心等着了……","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"商人话语的尾音淹没在驮兽车的轮子声中，红隼和蒂拉拉相视了一下，而后都笑了出来。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉你也去后面坐着吧，这会要到太阳最烈的时候了。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"“齿痕”总能做出来的，老坐在这里被晒着也不是个办法，留我一个人看着路就够了。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"等到了边境集市，我再帮你想想要怎么做吧。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"嗯！","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"快去吧！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"charslot","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_bg_bg_desert_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hornstart","volume":"1","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":140},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":141,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"冲锋的号角响起的时候，从驮兽车的前座上已经能看到边境集市所在的绿洲出现在远方的地平线上。","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"驮兽在听到声响的那一刻就停住了脚步，红隼当即就将手握在了刀柄上，裹着沙尘的蹄声正在飞速靠近。","id":143},{"type":"text","text":"商人慌张地探出头来，他脸上的汗珠绝不是因为荒野的温度。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"红隼小姐，这是……这不正常吧，不会真的遇到……","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"为什么要停下，我们跑不掉吗？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"跑不掉的，除非你愿意丢下所有货物。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"况且对付这种人，逃跑是最没用的，只能换来更坏的结果。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"最好躲在后面别出来，别让他们对你们下手。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#7$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉！千万不要出来，在后面好好躲着。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"篷车里只传来蒂拉拉的一声简短回应，红隼紧握着刀，只是看着卷起的沙尘里袭来的身影。","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"红隼小姐，这看起来不像随随便便就能应付的强盗啊……","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"如果你还想有胳膊有腿地带着你的东西离开萨尔贡，就听我的话回里面坐好。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"在我没命之前他们绝不可能动你们一根手指头。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"好……好……","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"text","text":"商人听到要保住财货，连忙带着半哑的嗓音缩了回去。","id":170},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"0.3","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"（人数不多……队伍不怎么整齐，应该是边境线附近游荡的流窜盗匪……）","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"（应该就是瞄着离开边境的商人来的……）","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"text","text":"飞速袭来的强盗队伍没有一点停下来的意思，红隼已经能看到他们裹着的头巾下的眼神。","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"而比那眼神更亮的，是他们手中举起的弯刀的刀刃上，反射出的刺眼阳光。","id":181},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","afrom":"0","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.9","id":191},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"false","id":192},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":195},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#7$1","duration":"2","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"还想再来一轮吗，就凭你们这些人，都伤不到我！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"包围篷车的劫匪都向后退了几步，只因在第一波冲锋之后，红隼面前的地面上多出了一具匪徒的尸体。","id":203},{"type":"text","text":"篷车前的驮兽不安地抬着兽蹄，红隼拉紧了缰绳，右手中锯刀上殷红的血液滴落而下。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"你们找错猎物了，趁现在赶紧滚开，不然的话这把刀会一样刺进你们每个人的喉咙。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"今天不管这车里是什么，你们一点都别想碰。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"红隼说着高举起手中的锯刀，刃口的鲜红色在烈日下格外显眼，在场剩下的若干匪徒看到后全部后退了两步。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"怕就对了，这条人命就是给你们的教训。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#7$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"把路让开！","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"charslot","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"匪徒们退后的脚步停了下来，篷车依然被包围着，红隼能看到袭击者的眼神依然凶狠，畏惧还没有击垮他们。","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"（这群人并不强，我一个人解决他们整队人不是不可能。）","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"（但如果这群人是不达目的不罢休的亡命之徒……）","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"……","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"她重新摆好了战斗姿态，在她面前的匪徒们手中的弯刀也又一次举了起来。","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"匪徒们的第二波冲锋来得很快，而红隼在对方冲击之前，就明白了匪徒们的目标并不是自己。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#8$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"车子！","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"charslot","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"弯刀的刃口朝向了前方的两头驮兽，彻底受惊的兽类高高抬起了前蹄，它们嘶鸣之后开始狂乱地试图挣脱缰绳的束缚。","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sundries","volume":"0.7","id":235},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_equipment_collapse","volume":"1","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"篷车在狂躁的驮兽挣扎之下很快就向一旁翻倒，红隼虽然挡开了匪徒的攻击，却完全无法阻止篷车倾覆。","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"哎哟！","id":238},{"type":"text","text":"怀抱着练习册子的女孩从篷车中摔了出来，在册子中夹着的纸张一下子散落到干燥的荒地上。","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#7$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉！小心！","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"在驮兽掀起的尘土中，匪徒们继续逼近。为首的匪徒抢出一步，提前绕向一侧，冲向了蒂拉拉的方向。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#6$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"可恶，玩这种招数！","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#7$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"别想伤到她！","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"不要！","id":255},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.9","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":260},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":261,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"站起来，蒂拉拉。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"已经没事了，他们逃跑了。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"红隼看向地面，自己脚下是抱着头发抖的蒂拉拉，和被自己刺穿了喉头的匪徒首领。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"而在自己的身后，还有一个刚刚倒下的匪徒。她转头面向蒂拉拉的时候，这个人举刀砍向了她的后背。","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"红隼姐，你的背上！","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"得快找点东西，把伤口的血止住！","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"只要你没事就好，我不能让他们碰到你们。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"把你画的“齿痕”收起来吧，这点伤没什么大碍。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"可是这些画……你看，全都是乱糟糟的图案不说，现在还沾上了血。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"比起关心这些已经没用的东西，还是赶快去集市看看伤势，红隼姐……你的血还在流……","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":282},{"type":"charslot","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"红隼看着蒂拉拉手中染血的习作，只是静静地把女孩拉到身边，拿过她手上的纸张。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"鲜血从她背上的伤口涌出，将她身上白色的图案染红。","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉，最早的“齿痕”就是用战士们自己的血画成的。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"正是因为这样，它才能让我们不忘记战士们的流血和牺牲。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"虽然从很早的时候起，人们就开始用颜料代替了血，但它的意义没有变过。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"我的“齿痕”，让我不能忘记自己守护的责任。这种不致命的伤口很快就会好，不用担心。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"倒是……那个商人……","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","duration":"1","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"我活着呢，我活着呢，吓死我了。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"charslot","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"旅行商人从倾倒的篷车中探出头来，虽然头发凌乱衣衫不整，但看不出他受了什么伤害。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"谢天谢地，还好箱子都固定好了，货都没事。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"红隼小姐，你的伤不要紧吧，我们还能赶到边境吗？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"没问题的，只是这两头驮兽受了伤，虽然只剩最后一段路了但也不能勉强。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"需要去集市里跑一趟，还要把车子收拾好。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"我去吧，红隼姐。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#8$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"那些匪徒虽然退了，但还没有走出太远，我怎么能让你一个人去。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"但……把你留在这里也不安全。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"这样吧，蒂拉拉，带上我的刀，快点去集市。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"他们尝过血的教训，不敢招惹刀主，这把刀可以保护你，我留在这里也能护着那位商人。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"你的刀……嗯，放心，我一定会安全跑到集市去的！","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"红隼姐你小心伤口，别太用力了。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"我尽快赶回来！","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"charslot","fadetime":"2","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"有个跟班真帮大忙了，红隼小姐。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉不是跟班，是我的学徒。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"或者说，比起学徒更像是我的朋友。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"学徒？可是你教给她的也不是战斗技巧嘛，你还真是个独特的战士呢。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"唉，不提了，还是先麻烦你收拾收拾车子吧。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"……","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"不一样的战士……吗。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"她捡起蒂拉拉掉在地上的册子，将那些被鲜血染成的“齿痕”小心地夹了进去，接着长舒了一口气。","id":349},{"type":"dialog","id":350},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_bg_bg_deserttownD.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":358},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":359,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"好险好险，都要到目的地了还有这样的遭遇，还好我出发前想到了应该雇个护卫。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"虽然车也要修，驮兽也换了两只新的，但比起这些来我的货都保下来了。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"红隼小姐，这杯酒不光是庆祝我们顺利到达，也是敬给你的！","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"让你来护卫真的是我这辈子花的最值的钱了，来，干一杯！","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#8$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"哦……那，干杯。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"只要你们两个没有伤到，我的任务就算达成了。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"面对那群亡命匪徒，这也算是值得庆祝的事情吧。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"charslot","id":375},{"type":"text","text":"红隼说着举起酒杯，眼神却朝向在自己身边静静看着习作的蒂拉拉。","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"咕……哇！痛快！","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"哎，说起来啊，红隼小姐，你和你的小徒弟一直捣鼓的是什么东西，画？","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"啊，你说“齿痕”？嗯，算是一种画吧，只有我们萨尔贡部族的人会做这样的东西。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"知道怎么画的人已经寥寥无几了，我打算把这种技巧传下去，才收了蒂拉拉当学徒。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"哦，已经没什么人知道这种技巧了？","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"嗯，曾经我们的部落每个战士都明白怎么绘制这些图案……","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"现在……在荒野上还有和我一样幸存下来的人，只是他们可能没法将这个技巧传下去。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"原来是这么稀少的东西，怪不得你刚才要舍命去保。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"看得出来，这种东西真的很有价值，就像我的货一样，哈哈！","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#8$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"价值？不，这可不是我为其战斗的理由。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"况且，“齿痕”是无价的，愿意跟随我的蒂拉拉更是如此。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"她放弃了安稳的生活，愿意和我一起旅行……","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"也谈不上放弃啦红隼姐，我也不太想在镇子上过一辈子。","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"虽然看着父母的店面也不错啦，但我总觉得不能一直守着过去的东西。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"所以当时红隼姐帮我家送了东西之后，我就问能不能收我做学徒。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#5$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"我以前也遇到过一些和你同龄的孩子们，但那时候我除了教会他们如何战斗，没能让他们明白更重要的事情……","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"说完红隼将杯中的酒一饮而尽，而后有些自顾自地看着空空的杯底。","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"也许在必须要守护的东西这一点上，那时候的我还没有完全弄清楚吧。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"有意思有意思，这还是我第一次听这样的故事。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"之前请的护卫也都很称职，只不过大都是只懂战斗的人，像你这样的还是第一次遇到。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"怎么会，沙漠中像我这样的战士多的是，只是很少有人能看到战士们的真正一面罢了。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"不过……","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"唉算了，还是喝酒吧！蒂拉拉，也别一直看着本子了，把你的气泡水举起来，我们干杯！","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"护送任务已经结束了，这是最后告别的机会。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"是啊，再喝最后一轮，我还要在天黑之前赶到下一个镇子。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"喝完我们就在此分别吧！","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#2$1","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"正合我意，来吧！","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"charslot","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三人一同","text":"干杯！","id":434},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":437},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":438},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"唔……这萨尔贡的酒也太烈了……还好没顺着红隼小姐的性子喝太多。","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"真是个有趣的人，她们那个沙漠艺术看起来还挺有特色的，听她说还那么少见……","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"行了，离开之前最后点一次货，然后就出发。","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"箱子数量……标记……都没问题。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"嗯？这是……？","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":454},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":455},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":456},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":457},{"type":"charslot","id":458},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":459},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_bg_53_g10_grandbazaar_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":462},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"bse","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"一周后，萨尔贡的某处集市。","id":464},{"type":"dialog","id":465},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":466,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","duration":"1","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"给，这是你的那份布料。这匹红色的是你的。别着急给钱，我一个个算！","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"嗯这一点刚好不用找，然后是——","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"charslot","id":473},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","duration":"1","id":475},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"老板！老板！","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"麻烦你帮我看个东西好不好，你知不知道哪里能找到画这些东西的人？","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":480},{"type":"charslot","id":481},{"type":"text","text":"布料商的摊位前，一位外族商人挥舞着一张画满图案的纸张，兴奋地询问着。","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"你们这里谁都行，要是帮我找到能画出这个东西的人，我可以给出超级丰厚的报酬！","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"嗯？这是什么东西……","id":486,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":487},{"type":"charslot","id":488},{"type":"text","text":"布料商疑惑地看向对方手中的图画，然后马上露出不屑的神色。","id":489},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"你这又是从哪儿弄过来的玩意，这不就是部落人画在身上的“齿痕”嘛。","id":491,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"对对对，就叫这个，能不能帮我找到两个人，会画这个玩意的。","id":493,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"这个东西可值钱了，我愿意出大钱，很多钱，找她们再做一些出来！","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"这位大哥，你怕不是被人骗了吧。我就看了一眼，这“齿痕”画的都不对。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"这种东西是部落的传承，画什么东西是有要求的，像你拿的这个从颜色到图案都是错的。","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"不信你去拿给别人看看，没有哪个人会说这纸上画的没问题。","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"而且就算是对的，也只不过是部落战士们用来记录战斗的玩意，这能卖什么高价啊？","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"不对不对，如今在收藏圈子里这可是抢手货，她们留在我货车里的就是这种画，在哥伦比亚被人高价收走了。","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_002","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅行商人","text":"那个人应该叫……对了，叫红隼，帮我找找这个人——","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_002.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_165","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔贡居民","text":"都说了——","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_npc_165.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":510},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"bse","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":513},{"type":"charslot","id":514},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":515},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":516},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":517},{"type":"text","text":"布料商的摊位之外，集市的人流之中。","id":518},{"type":"dialog","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":520},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"蒂拉拉，昨天你画出来的那份“齿痕”真的很漂亮。","id":522,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"虽然以前也从来没有人画出过那样的图案，但和你之前试着模仿的图案比起来，已经好很多了。","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"感觉就像是你忽然开窍了一样。","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"红隼姐你不记得啦，那天和那个商人分别之后，你又喝了很多酒。","id":528,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":529},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"晚上你和我说了好多话，虽然都不是关于怎么画“齿痕”的，但有一句话我记得很清楚。","id":530,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"你说自己永远都是战士，但也不会永远都在战斗。","id":532,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"所以我在想，“齿痕”是不是也是一样，它可以不只是战士们对过去的记录。","id":534,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"确实……它本来也可以看成一种祝福，就像首领教会我的守护图案一样。","id":536,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":537},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"不，红隼姐，我的意思是，我想画出我们看到的一切。","id":538,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"萨尔贡的人、荒野，还有每一个我们遇到的故事，也许都可以用“齿痕”去表达。","id":540,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"不是用血，也不用什么特殊的颜色，也不是用过去已经定好的图案……","id":542,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#3$1","id":543},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"……","id":544,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/ff/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#12$1","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"哈哈——！","id":546,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#12$1","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"当初你愿意和我一起走真的太好了，蒂拉拉！","id":548,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"对啊，首领当初为我做的一切，原来是这个意思啊。","id":550,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"是……什么？","id":552,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"其实很简单，蒂拉拉。","id":554,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"我还不用急着回办事处，接下来我们还有时间再转一转。","id":556,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"我也要和你一样去看看其他的地方，不只是荒野，还有更远的地方的人和事。","id":557,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":558},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"我们一起想想该怎么创造新的“齿痕”吧！","id":559,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":560},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"……","id":561,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_163","id":562},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂拉拉","text":"好的，红隼姐！","id":563,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_163.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4023_rfalcn_1#1$1","id":564},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红隼","text":"那就出发吧，先穿过这片荒野！","id":565,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4023_rfalcn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":566},{"type":"charslot","id":567},{"type":"text","text":"红隼举起手指向遥远的地平线，两人笑着走过嘈杂的人潮，走向荒野的方向。","id":568},{"type":"text","text":"烈日下的集市人流中，一个挥舞着纸张的外族人与她们悄然错过。","id":569},{"type":"dialog","id":570},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":571},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":572},{"type":"bgeffect","id":573},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":574},{"type":"image","id":575},{"type":"charslot","id":576}],"characters":["红隼","蒂拉拉","？？？","旅行商人","三人一同","萨尔贡居民"]}